{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 A Story About Change</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940010/extras/0f8d58894a738e03c7e4580dcae7054b.avif?t=1772519643\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of Lily, a young woman whose life changes unexpectedly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After arriving in Grimwood \u2014 a mysterious village cut off from civilization \u2014 Lily finds herself staying longer than she ever expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she begins to navigate life in this strange place, she gradually transforms\u2026 becoming someone she never imagined she could be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfac Season 1 \u2014 A Complete Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940010/extras/2a2649e603f4116934478468812e53f9.avif?t=1772519643\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season 1 is a fully self-contained story collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It explores several of Lily\u2019s possible futures through multiple distinct story routes \u2014 each with its own themes, tone, progression, and ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every route is complete and satisfying on its own.<br>You do not need Season 2 to enjoy or understand the stories presented here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season 2 will expand the world of Grimwood further, introducing new transformation paths and additional directions for Lily\u2019s evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfad Your Choices Shape Her</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea